+# Compressor diagnosis harness (DIAGNOSIS ONLY, never merged)
+
+Recorded in `docs/handoffs/effects-2026-09-27/compressor-diagnosis-harness.patch`; applies to
+`6ca203f8` (`codex/batch-plumbing-floor-2`). The prototypes patch applies on top of it.
+
+Build outside the timing lock, run pinned inside it:
+
+```text
+T=<scratch>/target; W=<scratch>/target-wasm
+CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$T cargo build --release -p compressor --example diag_kernel
+CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$T cargo build --release -p compressor --example diag_probe
+CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$T cargo test --release -p console-workload --test compressor_diag --no-run
+CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$W RUSTFLAGS="-C target-feature=+simd128" \
+  cargo build --release --target wasm32-unknown-unknown -p compressor-diag-guest -p wasm-console-guest
+
+$T/release/examples/diag_kernel verify [mode]     # replicas vs the real kernel, hostile inputs
+$T/release/examples/diag_kernel verify_mono       # mono prototypes vs mono base
+taskset -c 31 $T/release/examples/diag_kernel time [filter]
+taskset -c 31 $T/release/examples/diag_probe      # Zen 3 pipe-sharing probe
+DIAG_DISPATCH=8 DIAG_MODES=0,1,5,9,13,15 taskset -c 31 $T/release/deps/compressor_diag-* \
+  --ignored --nocapture --test-threads 1 rows      # DIAG_ROW=mono|console for other rows
+DIAG_MODE=15 $T/release/deps/compressor_diag-* --ignored --nocapture --test-threads 1 digests
+DIAG_SOURCE_OUT=source.bin $T/release/deps/compressor_diag-* --ignored --test-threads 1 dump_sources
+taskset -c 31 node --no-liftoff node_host.mjs $W/wasm32-unknown-unknown/release/compressor_diag_guest.wasm time
+taskset -c 31 node --no-liftoff node_console.mjs $W/wasm32-unknown-unknown/release/wasm_console_guest.wasm \
+  source.bin 0,1,5,9,13,15 5 6
+node --no-liftoff --print-wasm-code -e '...' | python3 v8_loops.py - <function index>
+```
+
+Kernel prototype modes (`compressor::diag::MODE`, read once per block): 0 today's body; bit 0
+loop hygiene (always on when nonzero); bit 1 DualMono link arm; bit 2 all-wet output arm; bit 3
+two-pass (targets first, 32-frame chunks). 15 is all four. 31 / 47 are the two-pass body's pass 1
+alone / pass 2 alone (diagnosis only).
